ContentEmblem: {
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Gives more bonuses the more content mods you have enabled
		Calamity Mod- +15% damage
		Calamity Fables- Drops a shroom mine when hurt
		Clamity Addon- Permanent Crate, Fishing, and Sonar buffs while equipped
		Calamity Infernum- +10% attack speed during any bossfight or invasion
		Catalyst- +15% crit chance
		Fargo's Souls- Causes friendly sand to rain down upon enemies near you at low health
		Thorium Mod- +5 Armor Penetration
		Thorium Hellheim- +10% max life during any bossfight or invasion
		Homeward Journey- doubled mining speed
		Exxo Avalon Origins- 20% increased damage reduction at full HP
		The Stars Above- Increases max life by max mana
		Secrets of the Shadows- Increased offensive stats while Invisibility buff is active
		Spirit Classic- +1.5 hp/s life regen
		Spirit Reforged- Increases luck by 1% of your current defense
		Consolaria- Grants 'human joystick' movement
		Spooky Mod- The player emits light above 80% life, grants 5 defense below 80% life
		Vitality Mod- Increases max health by 15%
		Split- Massively increased damage at the cost of almost all crit chance when facing left, guaranteed crits at the cost of some damage when facing right
		Macrocosm- Increased flight time and aerial movement
		Enigma Mod- All attacks inflict on fire and frostburn
		Paracosm- Increases life regen by the number of debuffs you have
		Ebonian Mod- All attacks have a 1/100 chance to give your enemies ligma
		Xenon Mod- Every 10th projectile attack spawns a large red X on the target
		Arsenal- 5% increased attack speed
		Terror Mode- +33% damage when under 33% health
		Storm's Additions- Occasionally causes lightning to strike enemies
		Ultraconyx- Trades 15% of your total defense for damage at an inflated exchange rate
		BeatriceMod- causes beams of trans energy to be radially fired out of the player periodically
		Gerd's Lab- Increases max Mana by 100
		Fish Guns Plus- +25 fishing power
		PG3D Weapons Pack- Every 3rd projectile attack fires an extra bullet projectile
		Flamethrowers Plus- 5% increased ranged crit chance
		Guns and Guns 2- 25% reduced ammo usage
		Awful Garbage Mod- +50 Max Braincells
		Rhymes With Grug Mod- Rhymes with Grug
		'''
	DisplayName: Content Emblem
}

