		[c/FF0000:The Lobotometer applies an increasingly annoying rainbow shader to the player's screen as Stupid weapons are used more.]
		[c/FF0000:The shader is MUCH more intense when playing in a GetFixedBoi world.]
		[c/FF0000:Certain Omni-class weapons also use this mechanic.]
		[c/FF0000:We have NOT made an 'Accessible Lobotometer' config **yet** but it will be added soon. My sincerest apologies to any epileptic folks playing the mod.]
		[c/FF0000:If you actually read all this, you can right-click this item to get the Signed Epilepsy Warning, which sells for a pretty penny or shimmers into Monster Stem Cells]
		'''
}

